      {
        "text": "Luz Maria Rivas is the U.S. Representative for California's 29th District, serving since 2025. Before that, she was in the California State Assembly from 2018 to 2024. She worked as an electrical engineer and founded the nonprofit DIY Girls. Her campaign says her top three issues are affordability, immigration, and preventing Donald Trump from doing more harm.",
