          {
            "text": "Her campaign says her top three issues are affordability, immigration, and preventing Donald Trump from doing more harm.",
            "cites": [3]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Her office says she co-led a 2026 letter asking ICE to restore transparency in its detainee locator system. She also voted to proceed with impeachment proceedings against President Trump. Rivas has sponsored the NSF REU Act of 2026 and the Department of Advanced Technology and Artificial Intelligence Act. She also cosponsored the Momnibus Act.",
